\subsection{Voltage Control with Blocking ADC Reads}
\label{sec:ctrl-v1}

The initial voltage loop used blocking ADC reads, adding conversion time directly to each control update. Acquisition, UART handling, and other foreground tasks therefore affected loop timing.

